{"title":"Speaker","description":"\u003ch1 data-end=\"282\" data-start=\"233\"\u003eZero Speaker Price in Pakistan (2026 Updated)\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"606\" data-start=\"306\"\u003eLooking for the best Bluetooth speaker in Pakistan? Zero Lifestyle presents a powerful portable speaker designed for music lovers, gamers, and anyone who wants high-quality sound on the go. Compact, stylish, and durable, this small speaker is ideal for home, office, or outdoor use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"606\" data-start=\"306\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"652\" data-start=\"613\"\u003eFeatures of Zero Lifestyle Speaker\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"682\" data-start=\"654\"\u003eSuperior Sound Quality\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"789\" data-start=\"683\"\u003eEnjoy rich audio with clear mids, crisp treble, and deep bass. This wireless speaker is perfect for:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"918\" data-start=\"791\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"838\" data-start=\"791\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"838\" data-start=\"793\"\u003eListening to music, podcasts, or audiobooks\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"868\" data-start=\"839\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"868\" data-start=\"841\"\u003eWatching movies or gaming\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"918\" data-start=\"869\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"918\" data-start=\"871\"\u003eHands-free calls with the built-in microphone\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"951\" data-start=\"920\"\u003ePortable \u0026amp; Compact Design\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1004\" data-start=\"952\"\u003eOur small speaker is designed for convenience:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1137\" data-start=\"1006\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1048\" data-start=\"1006\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1048\" data-start=\"1008\"\u003eLightweight and easy to carry anywhere\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1089\" data-start=\"1049\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1089\" data-start=\"1051\"\u003eIPX5 water-resistant for outdoor use\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1137\" data-start=\"1090\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1137\" data-start=\"1092\"\u003eSleek and modern design that fits any space\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"1176\" data-start=\"1139\"\u003eAdvanced Bluetooth Connectivity\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1323\" data-start=\"1177\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1239\" data-start=\"1177\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1239\" data-start=\"1179\"\u003eWorks with all Android, iOS, and Bluetooth-enabled devices\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1277\" data-start=\"1240\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1277\" data-start=\"1242\"\u003eStable connection up to 10 meters\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1323\" data-start=\"1278\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1323\" data-start=\"1280\"\u003eEasy pairing in seconds for instant audio\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"1348\" data-start=\"1325\"\u003eLong Battery Life\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1441\" data-start=\"1349\"\u003eThis portable speaker delivers hours of uninterrupted playback, making it perfect for:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1530\" data-start=\"1443\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1462\" data-start=\"1443\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1462\" data-start=\"1445\"\u003eDaily commuting\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1497\" data-start=\"1463\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1497\" data-start=\"1465\"\u003eOutdoor gatherings and picnics\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1530\" data-start=\"1498\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1530\" data-start=\"1500\"\u003eHome or office entertainment\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"1586\" data-start=\"1537\"\u003eWhy Choose Zero Lifestyle Bluetooth Speaker?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1914\" data-start=\"1588\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1659\" data-start=\"1588\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1659\" data-start=\"1590\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1613\" data-start=\"1590\"\u003eHigh-Quality Sound:\u003c\/strong\u003e Powerful audio for music, calls, and movies\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1733\" data-start=\"1660\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1733\" data-start=\"1662\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1685\" data-start=\"1662\"\u003eCompact \u0026amp; Portable:\u003c\/strong\u003e Small design ideal for indoor and outdoor use\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1807\" data-start=\"1734\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1807\" data-start=\"1736\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1759\" data-start=\"1736\"\u003eDurable \u0026amp; Reliable:\u003c\/strong\u003e Long-lasting performance and water resistance\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1914\" data-start=\"1808\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1914\" data-start=\"1810\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1825\" data-start=\"1810\"\u003eAffordable:\u003c\/strong\u003e Competitive Bluetooth speaker price in Pakistan and speakers price in Pakistan\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2206\" data-start=\"2173\"\u003eWho Should Buy This Speaker?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2522\" data-start=\"2208\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2278\" data-start=\"2208\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2278\" data-start=\"2210\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2227\" data-start=\"2210\"\u003eMusic Lovers:\u003c\/strong\u003e Enjoy crystal-clear sound and deep bass anywhere\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2362\" data-start=\"2279\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2362\" data-start=\"2281\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2312\" data-start=\"2281\"\u003eGamers \u0026amp; Movie Enthusiasts:\u003c\/strong\u003e Immersive audio experience for games and videos\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2436\" data-start=\"2363\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2436\" data-start=\"2365\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2395\" data-start=\"2365\"\u003eTravelers \u0026amp; Outdoor Users:\u003c\/strong\u003e Compact, portable, and water-resistant\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2522\" data-start=\"2437\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2522\" data-start=\"2439\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2458\" data-start=\"2439\"\u003eEveryday Users:\u003c\/strong\u003e Perfect for calls, music, and entertainment at home or office\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2560\" data-start=\"2529\"\u003eFrequently Asked Questions\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2701\" data-start=\"2562\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQ: Is this Bluetooth speaker compatible with all phones?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"2625\" data-start=\"2622\"\u003eA: Yes! It works with Android, iOS, and all Bluetooth-enabled devices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2795\" data-start=\"2703\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQ: How long is the battery life?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"2742\" data-start=\"2739\"\u003eA: 6–8 hours of continuous playback per charge.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2961\" data-start=\"2797\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQ: Do you ship across Pakistan?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"2835\" data-start=\"2832\"\u003eA: Yes! Delivery is available in Karachi, Lahore, Islamabad, Rawalpindi, Faisalabad, Multan, Peshawar, Quetta, and more.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3079\" data-start=\"2963\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQ: Is there a warranty?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"2993\" data-start=\"2990\"\u003eA: Yes, every Zero Lifestyle Bluetooth speaker comes with warranty coverage.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"thunder-speaker","title":"Thunder Pro Speaker","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"162\" data-end=\"430\"\u003eTurn up the energy with the \u003cstrong data-start=\"190\" data-end=\"209\"\u003eThunder Speaker\u003c\/strong\u003e, built to deliver powerful sound in a compact, stylish body. Designed for music lovers who want loud, clear audio on the go, the Thunder Speaker is perfect for indoor hangouts, outdoor gatherings, and everyday listening.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"719\"\u003eWith deep bass output, stable Bluetooth connectivity, and long-lasting battery performance, the Thunder Speaker keeps your playlists alive without interruptions. Its durable build and easy controls make it a reliable companion whether you’re chilling at home or heading out with friends.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":51000153309462,"sku":"23304","price":39999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Camou Grey","offer_id":51154395201814,"sku":"24003","price":39999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Thunder_Black01.webp?v=1774944134"}],"url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/collections\/speakers.oembed","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version":"1.0","type":"link"}